OL,5,G0900 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,6,G     Australia
OL,7,     FEbony and Andrea are tired of
OL,8,     Fbeing terrorised by their tiny
OL,9,     FMoodle Piper. She may be
OL,10,     Fminiature, but she's a maniac. Can
OL,11,     FGraeme Hall turn this dastardly
OL,12,     Fmutt into a lady?
OL,13,G1000 The Yorkshire Vet
OL,14,     FMatt Smith rushes out to help a
OL,15,     Fcow who has suffered a massive
OL,16,     Fprolapse after giving birth. And
OL,17,     FRohin Aojula is surprised by what
OL,18,     Fhe finds stuck in Luna the cat's
OL,19,     Fthroat.
